    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nYes, this (block selected with `$`) is indeed the edge case that can be made better. However, it won't be done in 'mini.surround' for the following reasons:\r\n- Combination of `respect_selection_type = true` and blockwise selection until the end of line seems to be quite rare in practice. It can also be replicated by using macro. For example, `10|` to navigate to the target column followed by `sa$\"`.\r\n- Actual implementation of this edge case is not trivial while 'mini.surround' is already quite a big and complicated module.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
